  "notes": {
    "howto": {
      "text": "This board is the whole prototype. Pick a thread in the sidebar, or an app above it. Models, alerts and Settings sit at the bottom of the sidebar; the project name at the top switches workspaces.\n\nA thread opens full width. The branch chip next to its title opens the thread card (⌘.): where it runs, Open in, the dev server, branch, changes and commit, model, permissions, issue, goal, pin and archive.\n\nSurfaces open in two panels that can be open together: the side panel (⌘J) and the bottom panel (⌃`). From either panel’s +, press a letter: D Diff, T Terminal, F Files, B Browser, A Agents, P Pull request, I Issue, S Side chat, N Brain, M Phone. Terminal opens at the bottom and the rest at the side, and each tab can move to the other panel or maximize. Each thread keeps its own layout. Files, commands and agents in the transcript open their surface too.\n\nDrag any panel edge to resize it. ⌘K reaches everything, ⌘F searches chats, ⌘I captures an issue, ? lists shortcuts, ⌥↓ ⌥↑ step through threads. Icons are Minnow’s own (Uicons, regular rounded).",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 0
    },
    "row1": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 3480,
      "text": "Graphite v4: one thread, its agents, and every app one click away",
