      "maxW": 6000,
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 11420,
      "text": "Less like an editor: a thread card in the chat, and surfaces you open when you need them"
    },
    "row10": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 6000,
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12740,
      "text": "More color: Minnow’s palettes as themes, with a color intensity you set"
    },
    "themenote": {
      "w": 420,
      "x": 6080,
      "y": 13040,
      "text": "Themes are Minnow’s palettes: Swamp, Ocean, Desert, Coral, Human, Mint and Mono, plus Graphite, which takes any accent. A theme sets the accent for dark and light mode. Color sets how much of it reaches the surfaces: Off is neutral grey, Subtle (the default) tints the ground, sheet and selected rows, and Rich goes further and tints your own messages. Diff, warning and syntax colors stay the same."
    }
